    "三条臂互成 120°，动物自由探索约 8 min。连续三次进入三条不同的臂记为一次交替，交替率 = 交替次数 ÷（总进入次数 − 2）。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Three arms meet at 120°. The animal explores freely for about 8 minutes. Visiting all three arms in three successive entries counts as an alternation; alternation rate is alternations / (entries − 2)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
