    "两只小鼠在同一场地自由互动，例如青少年社交、居住者-入侵者测试中的非攻击部分、雌雄互动。读数是各类嗅探与跟随行为的时间和次数。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Two freely moving mice interact in one arena, for example in juvenile social interactions, nonaggressive resident–intruder behavior or male–female interaction. Readouts include sniffing and following bouts and duration."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "两只小鼠在同一场地自由互动，例如青少年社交、居住者-入侵者测试中的非攻击部分、雌雄互动。读数是各类嗅探与跟随行为的时间和次数。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "两只自由活动小鼠 · 鼻对鼻、肛殖区嗅探、跟随" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
