    "两条开放臂与两条闭合臂交叉的高架迷宫，通常测 5 min。开放臂时间和进入次数比例越低，焦虑样行为越强。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "An elevated maze with two open and two closed arms, commonly tested for 5 min. Reduced open-arm time and entry fractions are often interpreted as more anxiety-like behavior."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "两条开放臂与两条闭合臂交叉的高架迷宫，通常测 5 min。开放臂时间和进入次数比例越低，焦虑样行为越强。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
