    "位置细胞、网格细胞记录通常让动物在开放场地中觅食数十分钟。分析放电野之前要先看占据是否均匀、覆盖度是否足够，并按速度阈值（如 > 2 cm/s）去掉静止时段。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Place-cell and grid-cell experiments often record animals for tens of minutes in open arenas. Before estimating firing fields, inspect occupancy uniformity and coverage and remove immobile periods using a speed threshold such as > 2 cm/s."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "位置细胞、网格细胞记录通常让动物在开放场地中觅食数十分钟。分析放电野之前要先看占据是否均匀、覆盖度是否足够，并按速度阈值（如 > 2 cm/s）去掉静止时段。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
