    "公认的“探索”定义是鼻尖距物体 ≤ 2 cm 且头朝向物体，爬到物体上或背对物体坐着都不算。质心半径法会把路过和坐在旁边也算进去。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A common operational definition of object investigation requires the nose to be within 2 cm of the object and facing it, excluding climbing or sitting beside it. A centroid-radius approach can overcount passing or nearby inactivity."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "公认的“探索”定义是鼻尖距物体 ≤ 2 cm 且头朝向物体，爬到物体上或背对物体坐着都不算。质心半径法会把路过和坐在旁边也算进去。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
