    "慢性社会挫败后的社交回避 · SI ratio" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Social avoidance after chronic social defeat · SI ratio"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "慢性社会挫败后的社交回避 · SI ratio"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "慢性社会挫败应激（CSDS）模型的标准读数。实验鼠在旷场中探索两次，每次 150 s：第一次网罩内为空（无目标），第二次放入陌生的攻击鼠（有目标）。比较两次在网罩周围互动区的停留时间，SI ratio < 1 通常归为易感。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A standard readout for chronic social defeat stress (CSDS). The mouse explores an open arena in two 150 s trials: first with an empty enclosure, then with an unfamiliar aggressor behind it. Interaction-zone dwell time is compared; SI ratio < 1 is commonly used as a susceptibility cutoff."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "慢性社会挫败应激（CSDS）模型的标准读数。实验鼠在旷场中探索两次，每次 150 s：第一次网罩内为空（无目标），第二次放入陌生的攻击鼠（有目标）。比较两次在网罩周围互动区的停留时间，SI ratio < 1 通常归为易感。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
