    "训练数据为灰度 / 红外视频，建议保持开启" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Training used grayscale / IR video; leave this enabled when appropriate."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "训练数据为灰度 / 红外视频，建议保持开启"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "训练期探索两个相同物体，间隔一段时间后把其中一个换成新物体。啮齿类天生偏好新物体，辨别指数 DI 反映识别记忆。移动物体位置即为物体位置记忆（OLM）。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In training, animals investigate two identical objects; after a delay, one is replaced with a novel object. Novelty preference is summarized by the discrimination index (DI). Changing an object's position instead tests object-location memory (OLM)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "训练期探索两个相同物体，间隔一段时间后把其中一个换成新物体。啮齿类天生偏好新物体，辨别指数 DI 反映识别记忆。移动物体位置即为物体位置记忆（OLM）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "记录头朝向细胞（ADN、后下托、压后皮层等）时，需要每一帧动物头部在环境中的朝向，以及每个方向上的停留时间（占据），用来归一化调谐曲线；角速度（AHV）用于分析 AHV 细胞和调谐的速度依赖性。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Recording head-direction cells (e.g., ADN, postsubiculum, retrosplenial cortex) requires framewise head orientation and directional occupancy to normalize tuning curves. Angular head velocity (AHV) supports AHV-cell analyses and speed-dependent tuning studies."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "记录头朝向细胞（ADN、后下托、压后皮层等）时，需要每一帧动物头部在环境中的朝向，以及每个方向上的停留时间（占据），用来归一化调谐曲线；角速度（AHV）用于分析 AHV 细胞和调谐的速度依赖性。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "记录系统与视频的同步偏移需自行对齐（导出 CSV 含逐帧时间戳）" : {
