    "运动像素法会把呼吸、光照闪烁和相机噪声也算进去。RodentStudio 用鼻尖、两耳中点、身体中心和尾根在 0.5 s 窗口内的位移速度判断僵直，头部的小动作（嗅探、扫视）不会被误判为僵直。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pixel-motion methods may be confounded by breathing, flicker and camera noise. RodentStudio uses displacement speeds of nose, ear midpoint, body center and tail base in a 0.5 s window; small head movements can prevent false freezing calls."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "运动像素法会把呼吸、光照闪烁和相机噪声也算进去。RodentStudio 用鼻尖、两耳中点、身体中心和尾根在 0.5 s 窗口内的位移速度判断僵直，头部的小动作（嗅探、扫视）不会被误判为僵直。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
