    "从透明底部仰拍时画面左右镜像，打开后同侧 / 对侧按动物自身方向换算。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Filming from below through a clear floor mirrors left and right; turn this on so that ipsilateral and contralateral follow the animal's own sides."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "从透明底部仰拍时画面左右镜像，打开后同侧 / 对侧按动物自身方向换算。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这些设置只影响统计，不需要重新识别。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "These settings only affect the statistics; the model does not need to run again."
