          }
        }
      }
    },
    "低于此置信度的关键点视为缺失。调高更严格（缺失更多），调低会保留更多不确定的点。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Keypoints below this confidence are treated as missing. Higher is stricter (more missing points); lower keeps more uncertain points."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "低于此置信度的关键点视为缺失。调高更严格（缺失更多），调低会保留更多不确定的点。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不超过这个时长的缺失按线性插值补齐；更长的缺口保持缺失。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gaps up to this length are filled by linear interpolation; longer gaps stay missing."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不超过这个时长的缺失按线性插值补齐；更长的缺口保持缺失。"
